    <string name="ref_dwv_slopes">Drainage Pipe Slopes (IPC / UPC):</string>
    <string name="ref_dwv_slopes_detail">• 2" or smaller: 1/4" per foot (2% gradient)\n• 3" to 6": 1/8" per foot (1% gradient)\n• 8" or larger: 1/16" per foot (0.5% gradient)</string>

    <string name="ref_water_velocity">Water Velocity Limits:</string>
    <string name="ref_water_velocity_detail">• Cold Water Lines: Max 8 ft/s (2.4 m/s)\n• Hot Water Lines (&gt;140°F/60°C): Max 5 ft/s (1.5 m/s) to prevent erosion-corrosion.</string>

